@baseUrl = http://localhost:7009

### List published blob names, sizes and timestamps
# Use fresh signed Telegram launch data from a private environment value. Never commit it.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/review/search-snapshots
Authorization: tma {{$processEnv REVIEW_TELEGRAM_INIT_DATA}}

### Look up the source channel linked to a discussion group
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/review/search-snapshots/groups/-1009876543210/channel
Authorization: tma {{$processEnv REVIEW_TELEGRAM_INIT_DATA}}

### Queue a rebuild by source channel ID (202 Accepted)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/review/search-snapshots/-1001234567890/reset
Authorization: tma {{$processEnv REVIEW_TELEGRAM_INIT_DATA}}

### Reject an invalid ID (400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/review/search-snapshots/0/reset
Authorization: tma {{$processEnv REVIEW_TELEGRAM_INIT_DATA}}
